            Finally, we checked the practical fit. A pump that needs a 14-inch pit is the wrong pump for an 11-inch clay tile, however good its curve. We noted minimum pit sizes where makers publish them, and flagged the pumps that will short-cycle in a standard basin. Every pick here is a real, currently sold model you can find on Amazon and at plumbing suppliers.
