            What we did not reward: marketing horsepower, stainless trim on otherwise ordinary pumps, and bundled kits that pad the box with a cheap check valve and a length of hose. If you have not yet worked out your inflow and head height, start with our guide to <a href="/what-size-sump-pump-do-i-need/">what size sump pump you need</a>, then come back here with two numbers in hand.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8 my-8">
