            <p class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Buy for flow at your head height, then buy the best switch you can afford.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed m-0">Horsepower tells you almost nothing. Gallons per minute at your actual total head tells you whether the pump can keep up, and the switch design tells you how long it will keep trying.</p>
